# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output is regenerable: keep it out of git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/build/*
/build/merged-image/*
/build/merged-image/*/implementation/

# EXCEPT the frozen capture corpus. Every replay runner reads it, and 102 tools
# hardcode `ROOT / 'build/rk3588-example-captures'`, so it cannot be moved out of
# build/ without editing all of them.
!/build/rk3588-example-captures/

# EXCEPT the emitted Image-A bitstream. This repo already tracks emitted
# bitstreams (build/framework-factored-sys-reset-v1/emission/full512-sys-reset.bit,
# 18 MB), and the deliverable must survive a fresh clone. Scope is deliberately
# narrow: re-including the whole `build/merged-image/` tree would drag ~1.7 GB of
# .dcp/.vvp probe output into git. Parent directories must be re-opened for git
# to descend into them at all.
!/build/merged-image/
!/build/merged-image/image-a-emit-20261111T041526Z/
!/build/merged-image/image-a-emit-20261111T041526Z/host-merged.bit
!/build/merged-image/image-a-emit-20261111T041526Z/host-merged.bit.sha256
!/build/merged-image/image-a-emit-20261111T041526Z/EMISSION_RECEIPT.json
!/build/merged-image/image-a-emit-20261111T041526Z/bitstream_drc.rpt
!/build/merged-image/image-a-emit-20261111T041526Z/BUILD_CLOSEOUT.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Toolchain scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.Xil/
*.jou
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Historical evidence archives stay local; only their text indexes are committed.
# `runs/**/*.tar.gz` does NOT match (a `**/` needs an intervening directory), so
# the recursive-name form is used instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tar.gz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Stray artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 78 MB Icarus vvp dump dropped in the repo root by an earlier run. Never
# referenced by the build.
/a.out
